sequenceDiagram
    participant Orders as Order Service
    participant Kafka as foc.rating.commands
    participant Rating as Rating service
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant DLQ as foc.rating.dlq

    Note over Orders: deliver, acknowledge, unacknowledge, or case resolve
    Orders->>Kafka: rating.permission.granted, key is the order id
    Kafka->>Rating: orderId, raterId, raterRole, rateeId, rateeRole
    alt another eventType
        Rating-->>Kafka: ignored
    else not JSON or fails the schema
        Rating->>DLQ: dead letter, reason invalid
    else rater or ratee is in deleted_user
        Rating-->>Kafka: deleted, nothing stored
    else valid grant
        Rating->>DB: insert rating_grant, conflict does nothing
        alt row inserted
            Note over Rating,DB: granted, the rater may now rate this order
        else same order and rater, or same eventId
            Note over Rating,DB: duplicate, nothing changes
        end
    end
    Note over Rating,DLQ: a handler that throws 4 times is dead-lettered with reason failed
